WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
kikoeru ka kikoeru darou

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
<i>Can you hear it? I'm sure you can...</i>

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
harukana todoroki

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>...that faraway roar!</i>

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
yami no naka kokoro yusaburu

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
<i>Your soul trembles in the darkness</i>

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
mezame hajimaru

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
<i>as it begins to awaken</i>

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
daichi wari sosoritatsu sugata

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>A towering figure shatters the earth</i>

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
seigi no akashi ka

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
<i>Is it the symbol of justice?</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
densetsu no kyojin no chikara

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>The legendary giant's power</i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
ginga kirisaku

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>will tear through the galaxy!</i>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
otakebi ga denkou sekka no

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Our war cry will summon</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
ichigeki wo yobu

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
<i>a flash of lightning!</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
furueru na hitomi korase yo

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>Have no fear, focus your eyes on...</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
fukkatsu no toki

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>the moment of resurrection!</i>

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
hito yo inochi yo hajimari wo miru

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>Mankind and all life witness it begin</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:03.160
<i>Space Runaway ldeon, Ideon</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>Space Runaway Ideon, Ideon</i>

00:01:28.440 --> 00:01:32.570
The Sixth Civilization spaceship cast out a flash of light.

00:01:32.570 --> 00:01:37.820
The radiance melted the ground and
vaporized the tides of the sea.

00:01:39.280 --> 00:01:45.120
The spaceship entered DS Drive,
in other words, subspace flight.

00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:54.670
<b>Infinite Power - The Legend of Ide</b>

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:12.860
A subspace drive?

00:02:12.860 --> 00:02:15.070
This spaceship is in subspace drive?

00:02:15.690 --> 00:02:18.570
The main engine suddenly started operating properly.

00:02:19.280 --> 00:02:21.780
Engine room! You didn't
activate it on your own, did you?

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:24.030
Wasn't it you who started it?

00:02:24.030 --> 00:02:27.910
How did this ship suddenly enter
DS Drive from Planet Solo?

00:02:28.660 --> 00:02:31.380
What the? The hatch looks completely different.

00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:33.460
We've entered DS Drive!

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:35.710
Is the Ideon set in the upper deck?

00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:37.800
So that's the spaceship's deck below?

00:02:50.480 --> 00:02:51.350
DS Drive?!

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:54.310
Joliver! Is the main engine working now?

00:02:54.310 --> 00:02:58.150
I don't know! We've entered DS Drive
with incoherent coordinates.

00:03:00.820 --> 00:03:01.990
DS Drive.

00:03:02.570 --> 00:03:04.570
It refers to subspace navigation.

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:11.540
Moving at the speed of light, it is possible to go
a distance that would take 2.5 million years to travel

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:14.170
in just a few months time using DS Drive.

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:19.760
However, the subspace is a completely different
 dimension that cannot be visually perceived.

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:25.640
It is an alternate dimension
linked with real time and space.

00:03:25.640 --> 00:03:29.360
If the subspace coordinates for points
 "E" and "F" can be calculated,

00:03:29.360 --> 00:03:33.100
it is possible to warp through real time-space.

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:38.820
However, it is difficult to determine the correct coordinates for navigation inside the subspace.

00:03:40.110 --> 00:03:42.150
We entered DS Drive without setting the coordinates?

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:44.660
Don't you know where we're going?!

00:03:46.070 --> 00:03:47.120
The DS Drive!

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:53.420
DS drive brake!

00:04:06.050 --> 00:04:07.050
I appreciate your efforts.

00:04:08.470 --> 00:04:10.520
It seems the enemy surpassed our expectations.

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:14.730
Gije, Damido, I want you to
prepare for subspace combat at once.

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:15.400
Roger!

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:16.690
Sir Abadede!

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:17.440
What is it?

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:20.400
The alien ship vanished from subspace radar!

00:04:20.980 --> 00:04:22.990
What the?! Where'd they vanish to?

00:04:22.990 --> 00:04:25.820
They vanished so abruptly that
we lost their coordinates!

00:04:25.820 --> 00:04:26.820
We'll try to locate them!

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:34.750
I see the ground!

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:38.340
Prepare to land!

00:05:09.030 --> 00:05:10.530
Isn't this planet Solo?

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:12.290
But why?!

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:16.120
If the main engine started working,
 the system should be functional...

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:17.670
It's not that simple.

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:20.790
Anyway, we ended up in the middle of an oil station.

00:05:20.790 --> 00:05:23.590
If the enemy finds us, this could become a sea of fire.

00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:24.760
But...

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:27.590
This ship isn't in good enough condition to be controlled.

00:05:28.130 --> 00:05:29.590
We should at least try!

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:33.270
We can't let the survivors get killed.

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:34.720
Right.

00:05:35.140 --> 00:05:37.640
That's the duty of the soldiers, correct?

00:05:37.640 --> 00:05:38.230
Yes.

00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:40.230
Do what you want.

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:41.310
I...

00:05:42.770 --> 00:05:44.690
I'm going to master using the Ideon!

00:05:44.690 --> 00:05:47.700
Just because I'm a woman doesn't
 mean I'm any worse than you!

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:50.410
She's so irritating.

00:05:50.410 --> 00:05:52.660
Huh? You want milk again?

00:05:53.740 --> 00:05:55.540
Didn't you just drink some?

00:05:56.160 --> 00:05:57.250
Oh Lou...

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:02.670
The aliens failed at subspace flight?

00:06:02.670 --> 00:06:07.800
Yes, it seems like the aliens were forced to make
an emergency landing on their planet, Logo Dau.

00:06:08.260 --> 00:06:09.970
I see... All right.

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:11.760
Attack them right away.

00:06:12.850 --> 00:06:15.810
But... We still don't know where Lady Karala is...

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:18.350
No, the attack is just for show.

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:22.940
During that time, I want you to sneak into
 the alien ship and rescue Lady Karala.

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:24.650
Roger!

00:06:44.130 --> 00:06:45.170
Okay, go!

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:03.520
Okay, raise it!

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:06.940
Alright!

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:14.320
Lou, wait for me!

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:17.330
We told you kids not to come down here!

00:07:17.330 --> 00:07:18.790
But Lou...

00:07:18.790 --> 00:07:19.910
They're coming!

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:26.170
Repair it fast, the enemies are here!

00:07:26.710 --> 00:07:28.250
We're finished repairing the armor!

00:07:28.250 --> 00:07:31.170
Just make sure you don't damage it, Kasha!

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:32.840
Hey, return to the ship!

00:07:32.840 --> 00:07:33.390
Yes!

00:07:34.010 --> 00:07:35.430
How's the engine control?

00:07:36.390 --> 00:07:38.100
What are you doing? Fire a barrage!

00:07:38.570 --> 00:07:41.430
But we're not finished adjusting the controls!

00:07:41.430 --> 00:07:43.020
Cosmo and I will take care of that!

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:44.520
Kasha, you handle the Ideon's missiles!

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:45.190
Yes sir!

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:02.540
All right! The electrical system's okay!

00:08:24.850 --> 00:08:25.610
It stood up!

00:08:26.810 --> 00:08:29.150
Bes, was that you? Don't move it on your own!

00:08:29.150 --> 00:08:31.070
I'm just testing the Ideon's balancer!

00:08:31.070 --> 00:08:33.570
Why are you doing it in the middle of an enemy attack?

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:36.360
You have no right to give me orders, Cosmo!

00:08:37.570 --> 00:08:38.370
Over there?!

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:45.040
Missiles, Glen Cannons,
 what are you doing?!

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:45.920
Behind us!

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:51.130
The balancer still hasn't been fixed!

00:08:51.130 --> 00:08:52.920
Blame it on the mechanics!

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:54.090
Sorry I'm late!

00:08:54.470 --> 00:08:55.760
Number 8 missile!

00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:00.510
Damn you all!

00:09:01.930 --> 00:09:04.230
Why isn't the Ideon launching?

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:07.600
The foot balancer hasn't been fixed
 well enough for it to properly stand.

00:09:07.600 --> 00:09:09.690
At this rate, this ship will blow up too!

00:09:27.870 --> 00:09:29.290
Damn you!

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:33.090
Where's the enemy?

00:09:36.510 --> 00:09:37.630
They're pulling back?

00:09:37.630 --> 00:09:39.090
Without doing anything?

00:09:39.840 --> 00:09:43.600
Maybe the enemy got tired
 of listening to you two quarrel?

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:51.560
The attack squad did well.

00:09:51.560 --> 00:09:54.570
They didn't appear to see us land...

00:09:54.570 --> 00:09:55.190
Let's hurry.

00:09:55.190 --> 00:09:55.740
Yes sir.

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:34.020
I don't want to hear any excuses...

00:10:33.520 --> 00:10:34.020
That is...

00:10:34.020 --> 00:10:35.320
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:39.150
You just need to connect the computers.

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:43.580
G-Gije!

00:10:44.490 --> 00:10:46.910
I've come here to see you. Where's Mayaya?

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:48.660
She's investigating this ship.

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:52.500
This place is dangerous. Please return to the mothership.

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:54.710
I'm still not finished investigating the Ide.

00:10:54.710 --> 00:10:56.800
That is our assignment.

00:10:56.800 --> 00:11:00.090
These aliens call that giant "Ideon."

00:11:00.630 --> 00:11:02.260
Ide...on?

00:11:02.260 --> 00:11:04.930
Furthermore, about this ship and the Giant...

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:07.020
I'll investigate them. Let's go!

00:11:15.520 --> 00:11:17.570
What is the matter, Lady Karala?

00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:20.650
It looks like this ship is powered by the Ide.

00:11:21.070 --> 00:11:23.530
Also, I want to learn more about these people.

00:11:24.910 --> 00:11:25.910
Surely you jest.

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:26.490
Raise your hands!

00:11:29.580 --> 00:11:32.040
So you were an alien spy after all!

00:11:33.370 --> 00:11:34.210
You won't get away with this!

00:11:40.170 --> 00:11:41.930
I don't like killing women, but I have no choice!

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:44.800
You bastard!

00:11:54.270 --> 00:11:56.730
So, what planet do you come from?

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:13.870
Sir Gije!

00:12:18.340 --> 00:12:19.250
A partner?

00:12:30.010 --> 00:12:31.640
Are you alright?

00:12:31.640 --> 00:12:32.930
No need to worry, old man.

00:12:33.270 --> 00:12:34.640
Lady Karala was there.

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:38.400
Inform Sir Abadede.

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:40.480
Tell him I'll save Lady Karala.

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:48.030
That's a nice looking girl!

00:12:48.030 --> 00:12:49.700
Is she really an alien?

00:12:55.110 --> 00:12:57.330
First, tell me your name.

00:12:58.380 --> 00:12:59.750
Karala Ajiba...

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:01.750
Where did you come from?

00:13:01.750 --> 00:13:05.590
Earth... More accurately, Planet Buff.

00:13:05.590 --> 00:13:07.590
Why are you attacking this planet?

00:13:07.590 --> 00:13:12.720
Because we thought of you as dangerous aliens.

00:13:13.430 --> 00:13:15.230
You think we're dangerous?

00:13:15.230 --> 00:13:20.900
Just like how you think I'm dangerous,
now that you know I'm an alien.

00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:22.900
W-well...

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:25.450
We were searching for the Ide.

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:26.110
Ide?

00:13:26.740 --> 00:13:27.910
What is "Ide"?

00:13:29.030 --> 00:13:31.330
The Ide possesses infinite power...

00:13:31.330 --> 00:13:33.040
An alien! There's another one!

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:36.080
Lady Karala!

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:41.210
Lady Karala is the daughter of the
Buff Clan's Supreme Commander!

00:13:41.210 --> 00:13:44.670
We'll get revenge if something happens to her!

00:13:45.260 --> 00:13:49.140
What are you saying? 
You're the ones who attacked first!

00:13:49.680 --> 00:13:53.220
We've now got to decide what
to do with these two aliens.

00:14:03.780 --> 00:14:05.900
Civilians, take shelter inside the spaceship!

00:14:05.900 --> 00:14:06.490
Let's go!

00:14:15.240 --> 00:14:18.040
Gije, I thought you returned...

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:19.000
I was merely pretending.

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:20.830
I'll get you!

00:14:22.590 --> 00:14:25.510
Lady Karala, let's take the Giant and get away!

00:14:34.850 --> 00:14:37.100
Hurry! We've got enemies!

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:39.520
Gije! Do you think we escape with like this?

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:42.730
They won't expect us to hide inside the ship.

00:14:42.730 --> 00:14:44.230
We'll take advantage of that.

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:46.940
Damn, the enemy's come!

00:14:49.780 --> 00:14:50.820
What the...!

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:52.780
Hey!

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:58.000
It seems similar to our machines.

00:14:59.160 --> 00:15:00.160
What are you doing?!

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:03.210
Mayaya, take care of him!

00:15:03.210 --> 00:15:04.920
Why? Why won't it move?

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:05.750
Gije!

00:15:06.210 --> 00:15:09.510
You're making a big mistake if you think
you can control the Ideon so easily.

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:11.510
Okay, that's enough!

00:15:21.100 --> 00:15:23.350
So, where is this "Debb Affei" planet?

00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:25.650
Dabro Groa Rata.

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:28.940
But you don't understand our speech,
 and I can't afford to tell you anyway.

00:15:29.570 --> 00:15:33.200
I won't disclose the location of our
homeworld to aliens and let it get invaded.

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:35.910
We Earthlings are a peaceful race.

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:39.370
Then why do you possess a Giant that holds such power?

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:43.670
It's a relic of the Sixth Civilization. It's not ours.

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:49.630
Up to this point, we've discovered
 the existence of five different alien races.

00:15:50.090 --> 00:15:55.090
I see. So the Giant is from the sixth group of aliens then?

00:15:55.930 --> 00:15:59.020
And that makes us the Seventh Civilization?

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:07.060
Karala, tell us of Ide, the infinite
energy you spoke of earlier.

00:16:07.060 --> 00:16:09.150
I'll tell you the Legend of Ide.

00:16:09.690 --> 00:16:13.450
It's an old Buff Clan tale.

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:46.730
Long ago, when the queen that ruled over Planet
 Buff was captured by a malevolent monster...

00:16:46.730 --> 00:16:50.070
All the light in the world vanished,
 and the greenery faded away.

00:16:50.570 --> 00:16:54.150
The Buff Clan were almost driven to extinction.

00:16:55.360 --> 00:17:00.450
But at that moment, a chivalrous hero
 appeared to stand against the monster.

00:17:16.720 --> 00:17:22.180
Against the monster's fearsome power,
 the hero's efforts were not enough.

00:17:57.800 --> 00:18:03.810
Using the power of Ide that the
 fruit held, he made the Queen his.

00:18:04.770 --> 00:18:09.850
And they ruled Planet Buff in peace.

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:21.570
What a ridiculous story.

00:18:22.070 --> 00:18:24.200
You fired your rockets because of that?

00:18:24.660 --> 00:18:28.210
On the top of everything,
 you attacked us and killed people!

00:18:28.620 --> 00:18:29.580
This isn't a joke!

00:18:30.120 --> 00:18:33.960
There is proof that supports the
 validity of the legend on our Earth.

00:18:33.960 --> 00:18:37.550
Something that confirms the existence
 of the Ide as new source of energy.

00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:37.970
That's a lie!

00:18:38.670 --> 00:18:42.140
You're destroying us all because of some absurd legend!

00:18:42.140 --> 00:18:43.050
We won't forgive you!

00:18:46.100 --> 00:18:50.100
You bastard! Do you know what
it means to strike a samurai?

00:18:50.100 --> 00:18:53.440
You're obsessed with a fairy tale!
 What right do you have to tell us anything?

00:18:54.150 --> 00:18:56.650
I believe the story of Ide isn't made up.

00:18:57.320 --> 00:19:01.280
It must mean something that the Ideon
 was found amongst the Sixth Civilization relics.

00:19:02.740 --> 00:19:03.620
Ideon...

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:08.000
Let me see the research you've done on it, Ms. Sheryl.

00:19:08.450 --> 00:19:12.120
If you want to see it, you'll have to kill us all first.

00:19:12.540 --> 00:19:16.550
That's right! How many thousands have you killed?!

00:19:17.590 --> 00:19:21.550
You bastards... Even your kids are hostile!

00:19:26.180 --> 00:19:30.180
Gije, that fool...  What can one person do alone?

00:19:30.180 --> 00:19:31.730
Let me head out.

00:19:31.730 --> 00:19:32.400
What?

00:19:32.810 --> 00:19:38.530
If we attack the enemy while they're
 at their weakest, we'll put fear in their hearts.

00:19:39.360 --> 00:19:41.860
With that, I'll be able to make
an exchange for Lady Karala.

00:19:43.110 --> 00:19:45.650
It will seem like a peaceful resolution.

00:19:45.650 --> 00:19:47.120
Fine, I'll leave it to you.

00:20:00.630 --> 00:20:03.090
What? There's an air raid near the spaceship?

00:20:03.090 --> 00:20:05.050
They're not attacking us directly!

00:20:05.850 --> 00:20:07.390
Put the enemy in confinement!

00:20:07.390 --> 00:20:08.010
Yes!

00:20:11.350 --> 00:20:12.440
Come on, stand!

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:21.360
Their mentality is similar to ours.

00:20:21.360 --> 00:20:23.570
They express the same reactions.

00:20:23.570 --> 00:20:24.910
Come, Lady Karala!

00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:26.200
G-Gije!

00:20:30.540 --> 00:20:33.500
Are all the missiles and Glen Cannons ready? Let's go!

00:20:39.590 --> 00:20:41.760
Attack the Giant from a distance!

00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:43.420
Don't get too close or you'll become its prey!

00:20:48.260 --> 00:20:50.430
What's happening? Isn't the gauge powering up?

00:21:03.440 --> 00:21:04.450
Damn you!

00:21:15.620 --> 00:21:16.620
Lady Karala!

00:21:17.170 --> 00:21:18.170
There he is!

00:21:20.040 --> 00:21:21.840
Do you have the orange signal emitter?

00:21:22.380 --> 00:21:23.460
Yes, but...

00:21:23.460 --> 00:21:25.590
We shouldn't be fighting these aliens.

00:21:25.590 --> 00:21:27.220
I think we should cooperate with them.

00:21:28.090 --> 00:21:29.010
Lady Karala!

00:21:30.800 --> 00:21:32.180
Cosmo! Behind us!

00:21:38.560 --> 00:21:39.770
My lady! Stay here!

00:21:39.770 --> 00:21:41.440
No, we need to get closer!

00:21:43.860 --> 00:21:45.150
Please get down!

00:21:54.750 --> 00:21:56.370
Mayaya! Emit the signal!

00:21:56.370 --> 00:21:57.000
Yes ma'am.

00:21:59.790 --> 00:22:00.420
What the?!

00:22:05.630 --> 00:22:06.340
What?!

00:22:06.340 --> 00:22:09.890
An unconditional ceasefire?!
Unconditional... ceasefire.

00:22:11.890 --> 00:22:13.140
They're pulling back?

00:22:13.140 --> 00:22:14.600
Because of that signal just now?

00:22:17.560 --> 00:22:18.730
They left...

00:22:19.980 --> 00:22:20.810
What about Gije?

00:22:21.480 --> 00:22:22.310
Lady Karala!

00:22:22.310 --> 00:22:22.900
What?

00:22:23.650 --> 00:22:24.980
This...

00:22:24.980 --> 00:22:27.360
Is this what you really want?

00:22:28.360 --> 00:22:30.610
They are an intelligent species like us.

00:22:31.070 --> 00:22:33.330
We should be able to understand each other.

00:22:33.330 --> 00:22:37.450
That woman... Why did she stop the battle?

00:22:52.510 --> 00:22:57.390
<i>Exhausted from the fighting, Bes and
the others try to contact the aliens.</i>

00:22:58.140 --> 00:23:00.560
<i>The white flag of truce is risen.</i>

00:23:00.560 --> 00:23:02.770
<i>However, Karala turns pale.</i>

00:23:03.360 --> 00:23:08.940
<i>For the approaching Buff Clan attack squadron,
the white flag has a different meaning...</i>

00:23:09.820 --> 00:23:14.700
<i>Next time on Legendary Giant Ideon:
 "The Deceiving White Flag."</i>

